{"id": "34321", "title": "长短脚之恋", "author": "白玉虹", "category": "文学名著", "count": 43, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34321.htm", "intro": "可恶！这男人竟叫她--小妹妹！岂有此理！她只是个子娇小了点，又生了张娃娃脸，居然被当成来电视台追偶像的花痴女学生！但这人的气势实在太吓人，让她不觉蹬蹬蹬向后退，闪他远远！嗄？他面恶心善，其实人很好？这……好啦好啦，虽然被他狠「劈」了几次，她也不得不认同。但……搞什么呀，他干嘛老爱抢她手中的咖啡喝？八卦满天飞，让她很困扰呢！不行不行，他什么也没表示，她可不想这样暧昧不清--呃……尴尬！他说他有和她表白过？难道是那个她喝了点酒、意识不清的夜里？哇！若是这样，那个她以为是梦境的吻，岂不是……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34321", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2181310.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2181311.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2181312.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2181313.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2181314.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2181315.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2181316.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2181317.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2181318.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2181319.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2181320.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2181321.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2181322.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2181323.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2181324.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2181325.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2181326.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2181327.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2181328.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2181329.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2181330.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2181331.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2181332.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2181333.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24